---
import StorefrontLayout from '../../layouts/Storefront.astro';
---

<StorefrontLayout 
  title="Authenticity Guarantee | Symeno"
  description="Our zero-tolerance policy and verification protocols for counterfeit goods."
>
  <div class="min-h-screen bg-base py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="mb-12">
        <h1 class="mb-4 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tighter text-content md:text-5xl uppercase">
          The Authenticity Directive.
        </h1>
        <p class="font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-brand uppercase">
          Last Updated: May 13, 2026
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-12 leading-relaxed font-light text-content-muted">
        <section>
          <p class="mb-4 text-lg">
            SYMENO LLC operates on a strict, zero-tolerance policy for counterfeit, gray-market, or refurbished goods masquerading as new. Trust in our logistics pipeline is our primary asset, and we defend it aggressively.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="mb-4 border-b border-outline pb-2 text-xl font-bold text-content">
            1. The Verification Protocol
          </h2>
          <p class="mb-4">
            Every unit that passes through our arbitrage network is subjected to rigorous cryptographic and physical supply chain verification. Before an allocation is cleared for dispatch, it must pass our multi-point inspection:
          </p>
          <ul class="mb-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5">
            <li><strong class="font-medium text-content">OEM Origin Tracing:</strong> We require direct-from-manufacturer bills of lading or verifiable Tier-1 distributor manifests for all inbound freight.</li>
            <li><strong class="font-medium text-content">Immutable Logging:</strong> Serial numbers, MAC addresses, and manufacturer cryptographic signatures are logged immutably against your order ID prior to dispatch.</li>
            <li><strong class="font-medium text-content">Seal Integrity:</strong> Factory seals, holographic identifiers, and tamper-evident packaging are visually and digitally verified.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="mb-4 border-b border-outline pb-2 text-xl font-bold text-content">
            2. The Symeno Warranty of Authenticity
          </h2>
          <p class="mb-4">
            We unconditionally guarantee the authenticity of every product sold through the Symeno platform. If any product is proven to be counterfeit or compromised:
          </p>
          <ul class="mb-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5">
            <li>The transaction will be reversed immediately, resulting in a 100% refund of the purchase price and all associated shipping costs.</li>
            <li>Symeno will cover the cost of secure return shipping to our forensics lab.</li>
            <li>The supplier responsible for the breach will be permanently blacklisted from our logistics network and reported to federal trade authorities.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="mb-4 border-b border-outline pb-2 text-xl font-bold text-content">
            3. Formal Dispute Resolution
          </h2>
          <p class="mb-4">
            If you suspect a compromised unit has bypassed our protocols, you must initiate a formal authenticity dispute within 14 days of delivery. Provide your Order ID, high-resolution images of the product and serial numbers, and a detailed description of the discrepancy.
          </p>
          <p class="mb-4">
            Initiate a dispute directly with our operations team at: <a href="mailto:support@symeno.com" class="text-brand hover:underline">support@symeno.com</a>.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</StorefrontLayout>